Z||000039||AusFiero||05-07-2001||10:24 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mrfixit58:<BR><B>Very nice! I hope your fiberglass skill are as good as your ideas or there will be a lot of disappointed forum members here   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ! Roy   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I think I will manage Roy. I spent 7 years in the car accessory industry making car spoilers, flared guards,  etc and race car bodies using composite materials (Kevlar & Carbon Fibre)and am also a qualified graphic artist. I am also a formally trained architectural draftman and spent a number of years working as a panelbeater/spraypainter as well. All these things sorta combine for my love of car bodies, don't know much about mechanical side of things but like nice curves  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>About to post body kit stage 2.<P>Gotta give me a little time on cost. Freight was the easy bit to work out. Gotta sit down with the calculator and plans for the rest.<BR>||||reg||1
